      "text": "happy new year from Senso-Ji, Tokyo’s oldest Buddhist temple 🏯\n\non nye, the temple’s bell joyanokane ring 108 times to drive away the 108 earthly temptations\n\nhere’s to a beautiful 2024 https://t.co/fDaEURoYpE",
