      "text": "while i’m glad the tech world is now embracing defense tech as a necessity…\n\nit’s late.\n\n2 hot wars. 500k dead in the Ukraine war. instability is dramatically rising\n\ndefense tech is meant to deter war, but we’ve crossed the rubicon\n\nwe need to now make up for lost time &amp; build",
