      "text": "my interests roughly by age\n\n0-12—math+chess all the time\n13-17—math+algos+physics all the time\n17-25—stopped doing math. tried to be cool. coded, read literature, played poker, traveled, went to concerts/parties\n25+—math all the time\n\nas I tell my nephew, math will set you free",
      "url": "https://x.com/alexandr_wang/status/1739691882802786737"
